# L §3.2 Period units: "1 year = 4 quarters = 12 months exactly ... So annual[y] * (1 month / 1 year) is a twelfth".
# 1 200.00 PLN × (1 month / 1 year) = 100 PLN (a num PLN: money × num, L §3.2 table).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "a source"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
unit hour "godzina"

input annual: money PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  annual = 1 200.00 PLN

ask q1: annual * (1 month / 1 year)
=== expect
q1: 100 PLN
  cut 2026-01-01
